          "description": "1,754,155 transaction records; original attributes include TRANSACTION_ID, TX_DATETIME, CUSTOMER_ID, TERMINAL_ID, TX_AMOUNT, TX_TIME_SECONDS, TX_TIME_DAYS, TX_FRAUD; 80/20 train-test split; training set expanded with SMOTE to 2,024,249 samples; test set kept at original distribution; input dimensionality after preprocessing is 6 features per transaction."
        },
        "data_preprocessing_details": "Removed irrelevant fields; interpolated missing values by variable type; standardized numerical features with Z-score normalization; label-encoded categorical variables; applied SMOTE to training set; constructed tensor-based sequential inputs.",
